    "abstract": "We report a Cu K-edge resonant inelastic x-ray scattering (RIXS) study of momentumdependent charge excitations in Nd2−xCexCuO4 (x = 0.075 and 0.18). The peak position and width of the excitations coincide excellently with those observed in Cu L3-edge RIXS. It demonstrates that the same charge excitations are observed at the two edges.",
